 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The wipers are worn and should be replaced. There are scratches and rock chips around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. The passenger side fender exhibits scratches, paint chips, and a dent. The paint shows some wear and tear that is consistent with age and mileage. The underside shows areas of surface rust. See pictures. The door mirror housings have miscellaneous scratches and rock chips The passenger side center window moldings appear faded, scratched, and discolored, while the driver side center window moldings are discolored and faded. All window lower window seals are discolored. The windshield has a crack and misc chips. The driver-side roof rack trim is peeling. The tires are dry-rotted, worn and have uneven wear. The tires are in an unsafe condition."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The steering wheel shows some wear and tear as seen in pics. Normal for mileage. There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The driver seat has light wear and medium wear on the side bolsters. The inner door panels show wear consistent with age and mileage. The front driver-side door panel shows heavy stains and wear, as does the front passenger-side door panel. Similarly, the rear passenger side and rear driver side door panels exhibit stains and wear. The interior trim shows heavy wear. . The center console is dirty. The dash is showing wear and tear consistent with the age of the vehicle. The carpet shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The floor mats are dirty. The headliner shows miscellaneous smudge marks from normal use. The check engine light is on, and the wrench icon is displayed on the driver's message center. The sun visors show wear and tear."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The engine bay and undercarriage components were visually examined for leakage, deterioration, and fluid conditions. The alternator and or battery is weak and does not pass 12.73V while running. The engine oil is on level and dark in colour. The front differential is actively leaking. The engine shows active oil leaks. The engine should be pressure washed off and rechecked to verify source of the leak or all leaks. The brake fluid is level and dark in colour. Only one key fob was shown during the inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "Performed a 2-mile test drive up to speeds of 20MPH in which the truck started right up and ran ok. However, the transmission does jerk hard, hesitate, slip, and function very poorly. I was unable to perform a proper test drive due to a major transmission problem. The steering wheel does pull a hard left. I hooked up my scan tool to the onboard ECU and found stored codes across multiple systems. See pictures of more descriptive information. More diagnoses are needed."
  }
